@@ -1,3 +1,13 @@
 # partial-checkout
 
-Small local library. Run `npm test`.
+`plan(stock, lines)` and `checkout(stock, lines)` fulfill whole lines in their
+original order. A line is accepted only if its complete quantity is available;
+duplicate SKUs therefore compete for the remaining stock, and unavailable lines
+do not consume anything.
+
+All lines are validated before checkout mutates stock. Invalid lines throw
+`TypeError`, leaving stock unchanged. `purchase(stock, lines, prices)` charges
+only accepted lines and returns their `totalCents` along with the accepted and
+rejected results.
+
+Run `npm test`.
